function Hash([string]$p){(Get-FileHash $p -Algorithm SHA256).Hash};function Logged([scriptblock]$c,[string]$l,[switch]$Append){$old=$ErrorActionPreference;$ErrorActionPreference='Continue';try{if($Append){&$c *>&1|Tee-Object -FilePath $l -Append|Out-Null}else{&$c *>&1|Tee-Object -FilePath $l|Out-Null};$LASTEXITCODE}finally{$ErrorActionPreference=$old}};function Artifacts([string]$b){@('mcla.exe','rexruntime.dll','TracyClient.dll','rexgpu-xenos.dll')|ForEach-Object{[ordered]@{name=$_;sha256=(Hash (Join-Path $b $_))}}};function TreeHash([string]$root){$entries=@(Get-ChildItem $root -Recurse -File|Where-Object{$_.Extension-cne'.bmp'}|Sort-Object FullName|ForEach-Object{[ordered]@{path=$_.FullName.Substring($root.Length).TrimStart('\').Replace('\','/');bytes=$_.Length;sha256=(Hash $_.FullName)}});$json=if($entries.Count){@($entries)|ConvertTo-Json -Compress -Depth 3}else{'[]'};$sha=[Security.Cryptography.SHA256]::Create();try{([BitConverter]::ToString($sha.ComputeHash($utf8.GetBytes($json)))).Replace('-','')}finally{$sha.Dispose()}}
function TreeInfo([string]$root){$entries=@(Get-ChildItem $root -Recurse -File|Sort-Object FullName|ForEach-Object{[ordered]@{path=$_.FullName.Substring($root.Length).TrimStart('\').Replace('\','/');bytes=$_.Length;sha256=(Hash $_.FullName)}});$json=if($entries.Count){@($entries)|ConvertTo-Json -Compress -Depth 3}else{'[]'};$sha=[Security.Cryptography.SHA256]::Create();try{$treeHash=([BitConverter]::ToString($sha.ComputeHash($utf8.GetBytes($json)))).Replace('-','')}finally{$sha.Dispose()};$bytes=0L;foreach($entry in $entries){$bytes+=[long]$entry.bytes};[pscustomobject]@{Hash=$treeHash;Count=$entries.Count;Bytes=$bytes}}
function Get-LogSet([string]$path){$dir=Split-Path $path;$files=@(Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $dir -File -Filter 'mcla*.log');$rot=@();$current=$null;foreach($f in $files){if($f.Name-ceq'mcla.log'){$current=$f}else{$x=[regex]::Match($f.Name,'^mcla\.([1-9][0-9]*)\.log$');if(-not$x.Success){throw 'Malformed runtime log rotation.'};$rot+=[pscustomobject]@{i=[int]$x.Groups[1].Value;f=$f}}};if(-not$current-or$files.Count-gt16){throw 'Runtime log topology is invalid.'};$ids=@($rot|ForEach-Object i|Sort-Object);for($i=0;$i-lt$ids.Count;$i++){if($ids[$i]-ne$i+1){throw 'Runtime log rotations are not contiguous.'}};$ordered=@($rot|Sort-Object i -Descending|ForEach-Object f)+$current;$manifest=@();$parts=@();$bytes=0L;foreach($f in $ordered){$bytes+=$f.Length;if($bytes-gt134217728){throw 'Runtime logs exceed 128 MiB.'};$manifest+=[ordered]@{name=$f.Name;bytes=$f.Length;sha256=(Hash $f.FullName)};$parts+=[IO.File]::ReadAllText($f.FullName)};$json=@($manifest)|ConvertTo-Json -Compress;$sha=[Security.Cryptography.SHA256]::Create();try{$setHash=([BitConverter]::ToString($sha.ComputeHash($utf8.GetBytes($json)))).Replace('-','')}finally{$sha.Dispose()};[pscustomobject]@{Files=@($manifest);Count=$manifest.Count;Bytes=$bytes;Hash=$setHash;Text=($parts-join"`n")}}
